# Project: SimpleGraphic macOS arm64 Port

This fork ports the SimpleGraphic C++ engine to native macOS Apple Silicon (arm64). All macOS work is on `macos-port`.

## Pick up here (2026-05-24)

**Engine (this repo):** `PLoadModule`, C-return stash wrappers, **`luaJIT_setmode` JIT off**, **`__mac_loadfile_stash_c`**, **`mac_run_after_main_if_requested`** (runs `LaunchAfterMain.lua` from C after `OnInit`).

**PoB (separate repo):** Three-file launch split — reference in **`docs/macos/pob-launch/`**:
- `Launch.lua` — minimal `OnInit` → `PLoadModule` → `launch._runAfterMain`
- `LaunchAfterMain.lua` — version `"?"`, callbacks, `main.Init`, xml (engine-loaded)
- `LaunchCallbacks.lua` — all other `launch:*` methods

**Verified locally:** `PLoadModule main type=table` in ~30–90 s with split. **#8 not done** until UI + `main.Init` complete.

**Next:** Rebuild/install → run full `Launch.lua` → PoB PR for launch files ([#9](https://github.com/braggpd/PathOfBuilding-SimpleGraphic/issues/9)). See **`MACOS_PORT.md` → “Next session — close #8”**.

**Do not:** bisect `Modules/Main.lua` first; assign `version* = "?"` before `PLoadModule`; put `__mac_dofile_c` or fat `OnInit` in `Launch.lua`; use `local f, err = loadfile(...)`.

## What NOT to touch

- Do not delete/replace Windows code — add `if(APPLE)` / `#ifdef __APPLE__` alongside.
- Engine repo: C++ only. PoB `src/` launch files live in PoB repo (reference copies under `docs/macos/pob-launch/`).
- Do not commit macOS work to `master`.

## macOS arm64 GC64 rules (Lua host)

- **C API returns:** stash globals + Lua wrappers (`GetTime`, `LoadModule`, `PLoadModule`, `PCall`, …).
- **`loadfile`:** use `__mac_loadfile_stash_c` + read `__mac_loadfile_chunk` / `__mac_loadfile_err` — never capture `loadfile()` returns in locals.
- **`PLoadModule`:** Lua wrapper only; use `if mainPlm.err` / `mainPlm.main`.
- **`require("xml")`:** after `PLoadModule("Modules/Main")`, not before.
- **No `type(node)`** in early manifest loops — numeric `for i = 1, #t`.
- **`mac_jit_off()`** via `luaJIT_setmode` before script; `jit.opt.start` stubbed.
- Use **`ConPrintf`**, not `print()`, in test scripts.

## What passes (`~/PoB-PoE2-build`)

- `Launch_oninit_pload.lua`, `Launch_stub.lua` — regression
- Split **`Launch.lua`** — reaches `PLoadModule main type=table` (then AfterMain / Init)

## Build & install (every session)

```bash
cp "$ENGINE_REPO"/ui_api.cpp "$ENGINE_REPO"/ui_main.cpp "$ENGINE_REPO"/ui_main.h ~/PoB-SimpleGraphic-build/
ninja -C ~/PoB-SimpleGraphic-build/build
cmake --install ~/PoB-SimpleGraphic-build/build --prefix ~/PoB-PoE2-build/runtime-macos
```

No spaces in engine build path. Symlink `runtime/SimpleGraphic` → `runtime-macos/SimpleGraphic`.

## Dev launch

```bash
cd ~/PoB-PoE2-build
./runtime-macos/"Path of Building-PoE2" ./src/Launch.lua
```

Wait **50–90+ s** for `PLoadModule main type=table`; **1–3+ minutes** for first `main.Init` — do not kill early.

